<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>GridLock: DESC and Georgia Power planned projects</name><open>1</open><description><![CDATA[Where Dominion Energy South Carolina's and Georgia Power's planned transmission projects come close in place and time: 78 overlaps, ranked by the gap between the closest points of the two projects and by how much their build windows overlap. Tiers: 1 touching / crossing; 2 under 1.6 km; 3 under 8 km; 4 under 40 km. 217 of 252 projects are mapped. Double-click an overlap to fly to it.<br/><br/>Sources: DESC Planned Transmission Projects $2M and above (2024-2028); Georgia Power 2025 IRP Vol. 3, 2024 GA ITS Ten-Year Plan (public disclosure version); substation locations from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Made for ShellHacks 2026, Sperry Tech GridLock challenge: https://github.com/jasc1204/shellhacks-2026]]></description><LookAt><longitude>-81.550000</longitude><latitude>32.850000</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><heading>0.0</heading><tilt>0</tilt><range>330000</range><altitudeMode>relativeToGround</altitudeMode></LookAt><Style id="desc"><IconStyle><color>ffffd84d</color><scale>0.9</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ffffffff</color><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ffffd84d</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><BalloonStyle><text>&lt;b&gt;$[name]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;$[description]</text></BalloonStyle></Style><Style id="gpc"><IconStyle><color>ffff7d3b</color><scale>0.9</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/placemark_circle.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ffffffff</color><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ffff7d3b</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><BalloonStyle><text>&lt;b&gt;$[name]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;$[description]</text></BalloonStyle></Style><Style id="top_n"><IconStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><scale>1.3</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/star.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><scale>1.0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><width>6</width></LineStyle><BalloonStyle><text>&lt;b&gt;$[name]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;$[description]</text></BalloonStyle></Style><Style id="top_h"><IconStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><scale>1.5</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/star.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><scale>1.1</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><width>7</width></LineStyle><BalloonStyle><text>&lt;b&gt;$[name]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;$[description]</text></BalloonStyle></Style><StyleMap id="top"><Pair><key>normal</key><styleUrl>#top_n</styleUrl></Pair><Pair><key>highlight</key><styleUrl>#top_h</styleUrl></Pair></StyleMap><Style id="ovl_n"><IconStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><scale>0.9</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/star.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><scale>0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><width>3.5</width></LineStyle><BalloonStyle><text>&lt;b&gt;$[name]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;$[description]</text></BalloonStyle></Style><Style id="ovl_h"><IconStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/shapes/star.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><scale>1.0</scale></LabelStyle><LineStyle><color>ff66d1ff</color><width>4.5</width></LineStyle><BalloonStyle><text>&lt;b&gt;$[name]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;$[description]</text></BalloonStyle></Style><StyleMap id="ovl"><Pair><key>normal</key><styleUrl>#ovl_n</styleUrl></Pair><Pair><key>highlight</key><styleUrl>#ovl_h</styleUrl></Pair></StyleMap><Folder><name>Overlaps, ranked (78)</name><open>1</open><Placemark><name>#1 (0.94 km)</name><Snippet maxLines="2">Jasper – Okatie × MCINTOSH – PURRYSBURG, build windows overlap by 24 months</Snippet><description><![CDATA[<b>#1 of 78</b>, Tier 2 (under 1.6 km)<br/>Can share the land itself: right-of-way, access roads, permits<br/><br/><b>Closest points:</b> 0.94 km apart<br/><b>Center to center:</b> 6.8 km (4.2 mi), the starter guide's measure<br/><b>Timing:</b> build windows overlap by 24 months; in-service dates 152 days apart<br/><b>Rough savings if coordinated:</b> $1.02M<ul><li>$714K: one crew and equipment mobilization avoided (3% of DESC's published $23.8M)</li><li>$310K: right-of-way, 1.9 km of shared corridor × 45 m wide = 21 acres at $15K/acre</li></ul><b>Score:</b> 84.8 / 100 (65% distance, 35% timing)<br/><br/><b>DESC_23</b> Jasper – Okatie 230 kV #2: Construct<br/>Dominion Energy SC (DESC), build window Jan 2023 – Dec 2025, in service Dec 2025, $23.8M<br/><i>DESC Planned Transmission Projects $2M and above (2024-2028), PDF page 23</i><br/><br/><b>GPC_20277</b> SAV: MCINTOSH - PURRYSBURG 230KV REACTORS<br/>Georgia Power (GPC), build window Jan 2024 – Jun 2026, in service Jun 2026<br/><i>Georgia Power 2025 IRP Vol. 3 (public disclosure): 2024 GA ITS Ten-Year Plan (2025-2034), PDF page 227</i>]]></description><LookAt><longitude>-81.126360</longitude><latitude>32.363077</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><heading>249.4</heading><tilt>50</tilt><range>2350</range><altitudeMode>relativeToGround</altitudeMode></LookAt><styleUrl>#top</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="rank"><value>1</value></Data><Data name="tier"><value>2</value></Data><Data name="closest_km"><value>0.94</value></Data><Data name="center_mi"><value>4.21</value></Data><Data name="desc_project"><value>DESC_23</value></Data><Data name="gpc_project"><value>GPC_20277</value></Data><Data name="desc_window"><value>2023-01-01 to 2025-12-31</value></Data><Data name="gpc_window"><value>2024-01-01 to 2026-06-01</value></Data><Data name="build_overlap_days"><value>730</value></Data><Data name="window_gap_days"><value>0</value></Data><Data name="isd_gap_days"><value>152</value></Data><Data name="score"><value>84.8</value></Data><Data name="est_savings_usd"><value>1023863</value></Data><Data name="needs_location_check"><value>false</value></Data></ExtendedData><MultiGeometry><Point><coordinates>-81.126360,32.363077,0</coordinates></Point><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-81.124600,32.359120,0 -81.128120,32.367034,0</coordinates></LineString></MultiGeometry></Placemark><Placemark><name>#2 (2.10 km)</name><Snippet maxLines="2">Urquhart – Toolebeck × FENWICK STREET – SAND BAR FERRY, build windows overlap by 41 months</Snippet><description><![CDATA[<b>#2 of 78</b>, Tier 3 (under 8 km)<br/>Can share site logistics: laydown yards, deliveries<br/><br/><b>Closest points:</b> 2.10 km apart<br/><b>Center to center:</b> 15.9 km (9.9 mi), the starter guide's measure<br/><b>Timing:</b> build windows overlap by 41 months; in-service dates 72 days apart<br/><b>Rough savings if coordinated:</b> $526K<ul><li>$526K: one crew and equipment mobilization avoided (3% of DESC's published $17.5M)</li></ul><b>Score:</b> 66.8 / 100 (65% distance, 35% timing)<br/><br/><b>DESC_35</b> Urquhart – Toolebeck 115kV line: Rebuild<br/>Dominion Energy SC (DESC), build window Jan 2023 – Aug 2026, in service Aug 2026, $17.5M<br/><i>DESC Planned Transmission Projects $2M and above (2024-2028), PDF page 35</i><br/><br/><b>GPC_16007</b> FENWICK STREET - SAND BAR FERRY 115KV (RECONDUCTOR/REBUILD)<br/>Georgia Power (GPC), build window Sep 2022 – Jun 2026, in service Jun 2026<br/><i>Georgia Power 2025 IRP Vol. 3 (public disclosure): 2024 GA ITS Ten-Year Plan (2025-2034), PDF page 261</i><br/><br/><i>At least one end is located approximately: check it before relying on this match.</i>]]></description><LookAt><longitude>-81.915891</longitude><latitude>33.440969</latitude><altitude>0</altitude><heading>233.7</heading><tilt>50</tilt><range>5238</range><altitudeMode>relativeToGround</altitudeMode></LookAt><styleUrl>#top</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="rank"><value>2</value></Data><Data name="tier"><value>3</value></Data><Data name="closest_km"><value>2.095</v